1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:03,300
Su Yurou

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,466
Before telling a story

3
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:07,166
you should at least make sure

4
00:00:07,266 --> 00:00:08,800
whose name is in it

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,400
Please tell the truth

6
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,066
Miss Su, please show the originals

7
00:00:19,266 --> 00:00:20,066
The originals

8
00:00:20,566 --> 00:00:21,800
I didn't bring them today

9
00:00:22,033 --> 00:00:22,966
Why not

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,266
I was afraid of losing them

11
00:00:25,366 --> 00:00:26,800
so I only brought the copies

12
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:29,366
You said you've kept

13
00:00:29,366 --> 00:00:30,400
these things all along

14
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,266
Yes

15
00:00:31,266 --> 00:00:32,066
Where did you keep them

16
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,200
What color was the box

17
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,400
Was it wrapped in anything

18
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:35,966
Was the original receipt folded

19
00:00:35,966 --> 00:00:37,300
What was the pendant placed under

20
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,800
That was 15 years ago

21
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:40,000
It's normal I can't remember clearly

22
00:00:40,066 --> 00:00:41,066
It is normal

23
00:00:41,166 --> 00:00:42,300
Then how can you be sure

24
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,433
you were the one who saved him

25
00:00:43,766 --> 00:00:45,266
Sister, from the very beginning

26
00:00:45,266 --> 00:00:46,233
did you just not want me to speak

27
00:00:46,233 --> 00:00:47,366
I didn't stop you from speaking

28
00:00:47,433 --> 00:00:49,033
I just asked you to provide full evidence

29
00:00:49,033 --> 00:00:51,633
Su Yurou, you have two choices now

30
00:00:51,833 --> 00:00:53,466
First, show the originals and let Fu Group

31
00:00:53,466 --> 00:00:54,900
and the hospital verify them. Second

32
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,200
admit that you can't prove right now

33
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:57,200
these things belong to the Fu family

34
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,633
Tears won't validate the past

35
00:00:59,233 --> 00:01:00,000
I just wanted to help Mr. Fu find his past
